      "settings": {
        "pf_bbd5c071_value": "<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/about-us\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">About Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Contact Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/terms-conditions\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Terms & Conditions</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Privacy Po<sup></sup><sup></sup>licy</a>",
        "pf_aaf301ba_value": "ThePhotoStick OMNI is a small but powerful device that automatically finds, sorts, and safely backs up your photos, videos and other files. It's perfect for anyone who wants to keep their memories safe and organized WITHOUT all the hassle, time, and money it would cost to do it yourself!",
        "pf_03ff12c9_value": "I had a grand total of about 60,000 images, with many duplicates. This little “stick” managed to eliminate the duplicates so that I now have about 24,000 originals preserved forever in a fire-proof vault, a cost-free and independent method of safekeeping.",
        "pf_3c72a5ce_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Convenient &amp; Secure -</span> ThePhotoStick® OMNI keeps all your most important files right at your fingertips, so they're easily accessible when you need them – yet stored safely and away from hackers.",
        "pf_7f7efc45_value": "The Photo Stick works just the way it says it does; very easy to use. I checked it when done, and there were my pictures. There is so much room on the stick that I should be able to use it for years to backup documents and pictures.",
        "pf_f1eaddb3_value": "This thing is amazing! Plugged it into my iMac and it found all my pics and saved them. 85,000+ pics saved! Saved storage space on my computer and now I have all of these memories over the past decade saved in a safe place.",
        "pf_23261259_value": "ThePhotoStick® OMNI keeps all your most important files right at your fingertips, so they're easily accessible on any device, without an internet connection, when you need them – yet stored safely and away from hackers.",
        "pf_ac9b49dc_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Easy To Use -</span> Simply plug in ThePhotoStick® OMNI and click 'GO'! It does everything automatically. No complicated setup, logins, or software to install!",
        "pf_dc09c33c_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Works On All Devices -</span> Works on all computers, phones and operating systems – including Windows, Apple, Android, Google, and more!",
        "pf_5fd037d4_value": "Your phone contains many photos and videos of loved ones and special occasions. Don’t risk losing them to a technical fault or a lost or broken phone.\n",
        "pf_9a300035_value": "65% of people or their family members have lost their files as a result of accidental deletion, hardware failure, or software problem.&nbsp;",
        "pf_bd778f0a_value": "Works with nearly all modern devices including phones, laptops, tablets, and desktop computers.",
        "pf_598bb703_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">\"I now have about 24,000 originals preserved forever\"</span>",
        "pf_d52919d5_value": "Automatically organizes your files neatly into folders so they’re easy to find.\r\r",
        "pf_f586b60a_value": "Searches EVERY file &amp; folder to ensure no picture or video is ever missed.\r\r",
        "pf_44f2d149_value": "Never worry about your computer crashing or losing files in the cloud again.\r\r",
        "pf_a24aaf7f_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">“Works just the way it says it does.”</span>",
        "pf_473aa359_value": "Backs up 1000’s of files in minutes without the monthly cost of iCloud!\n",
        "pf_f613ad82_value": "Your photos and videos are safely stored in minutes and ready to share!",
        "pf_5d628297_value": "Removable memory card means that you will never run out of storage!\n",
        "pf_c62bcece_value": "Easily plugs into the USB slot on your computer, phone, or tablet.",
        "pf_3dd2bf5f_value": "Keep Your Memories Safe And Accessible With ThePhotoStick® Omni!\n",
        "pf_f2cdd282_value": "Instantly back up new files whenever you charge your phone&nbsp;",
